<p data-start=3D"4562" data-end=3D"4700" class=3D"">En ouvrant cette page d=
ans votre navigateur, vous pouvez voir le message "Bonjour, JavaScript !" a=
ffich=C3=A9 dans la console de d=C3=A9veloppement.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4702" data-end=3D"4754" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4706" data-end=3D"4754">Utiliser la console JavaScript du navigateur</stron=
g></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4756" data-end=3D"4886" class=3D"">Les navigateurs moderne=
s ont des consoles int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9es qui permettent d'ex=C3=A9cuter des s=
cripts JavaScript directement. Pour y acc=C3=A9der :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4887" data-end=3D"5156">
<li data-start=3D"4887" data-end=3D"4927" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4890" data-end=3D"4927" class=3D"">Faites un clic droit su=
r la page web.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4928" data-end=3D"5032" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5032" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez "Insp=
ecter" (ou appuyez sur <code data-start=3D"4972" data-end=3D"4986">Ctrl+Shi=
ft+I</code> sous Windows/Linux ou <code data-start=3D"5009" data-end=3D"502=
0">Cmd+Opt+I</code> sur macOS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5033" data-end=3D"5066" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5036" data-end=3D"5066" class=3D"">Allez dans l'onglet "Co=
nsole".</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5067" data-end=3D"5156" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5070" data-end=3D"5156" class=3D"">Vous pouvez alors entre=
r des commandes JavaScript et voir les r=C3=A9sultats en temps r=C3=A9el.</=
p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5158" data-end=3D"5161" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5163" data-end=3D"5192" class=3D"">3. Les bases de JavaSc=
ript</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5194" data-end=3D"5218" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5198" data-end=3D"5218">Types de donn=C3=A9es</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5220" data-end=3D"5267" class=3D"">JavaScript propose plus=
ieurs types de donn=C3=A9es :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5268" data-end=3D"5613">
<li data-start=3D"5268" data-end=3D"5326" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5270" data-end=3D"5326" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
270" data-end=3D"5280">String</strong> : Une cha=C3=AEne de caract=C3=A8res=
 (ex. <code data-start=3D"5313" data-end=3D"5324">"Bonjour"</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5327" data-end=3D"5363" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5329" data-end=3D"5363" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
329" data-end=3D"5339">Number</strong> : Un nombre (ex. <code data-start=3D=
"5357" data-end=3D"5361">42</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5364" data-end=3D"5419" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5366" data-end=3D"5419" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
366" data-end=3D"5377">Boolean</strong> : Une valeur logique (<code data-st=
art=3D"5400" data-end=3D"5406">true</code> ou <code data-start=3D"5410" dat=
a-end=3D"5417">false</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5420" data-end=3D"5450" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5422" data-end=3D"5450" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
422" data-end=3D"5430">Null</strong> : Une valeur nulle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5451" data-end=3D"5528" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5453" data-end=3D"5528" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
453" data-end=3D"5466">Undefined</strong> : Une variable qui a =C3=A9t=C3=
=A9 d=C3=A9clar=C3=A9e mais qui n=E2=80=99a pas de valeur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5529" data-end=3D"5613" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5531" data-end=3D"5613" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
531" data-end=3D"5541">Object</strong> : Une collection de paires cl=C3=A9-=
