<h3 data-start=3D"3476" data-end=3D"3499" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3480" data-end=3D"3499">Port=C3=A9e de <code data-start=3D"3492" data-end=
=3D"3497">var</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3501" data-end=3D"3766" class=3D"">La port=C3=A9e d=E2=80=
=99une variable d=C3=A9clar=C3=A9e avec <code data-start=3D"3540" data-end=
=3D"3545">var</code> est fonctionnelle ou globale, et non bas=C3=A9e sur le=
