2881" data-end=3D"2927">Tri croissant et d=C3=A9croissant avec <code data-s=
tart=3D"2917" data-end=3D"2925">sort()</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2929" data-end=3D"3021" class=3D"">La m=C3=A9thode <code d=
