<p data-start=3D"3353" data-end=3D"3430" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
353" data-end=3D"3366">mouseover</strong> : Se produit lorsque la souris en=
tre dans la zone d'un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3431" data-end=3D"3506" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3434" data-end=3D"3506" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
434" data-end=3D"3446">mouseout</strong> : Se produit lorsque la souris qui=
tte la zone d'un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3507" data-end=3D"3597" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3510" data-end=3D"3597" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
510" data-end=3D"3523">mousedown</strong> : Se d=C3=A9clenche lorsque le bo=
uton de la souris est enfonc=C3=A9 sur un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3598" data-end=3D"3686" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3601" data-end=3D"3686" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
601" data-end=3D"3612">mouseup</strong> : Se d=C3=A9clenche lorsque le bout=
on de la souris est rel=C3=A2ch=C3=A9 sur un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"3688" data-end=3D"3717" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3692" data-end=3D"3717">=C3=89v=C3=A9nements de clavier</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3719" data-end=3D"4030">
<li data-start=3D"3719" data-end=3D"3803" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3722" data-end=3D"3803" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
722" data-end=3D"3733">keydown</strong> : Cet =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement se produi=
t lorsqu'une touche du clavier est enfonc=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3886" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3807" data-end=3D"3886" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
807" data-end=3D"3816">keyup</strong> : Cet =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement se produit =
lorsque la touche du clavier est rel=C3=A2ch=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3887" data-end=3D"4030" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3890" data-end=3D"4030" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
890" data-end=3D"3902">keypress</strong> : Se produit lorsqu'une touche est=
 enfonc=C3=A9e et qu'elle produit un caract=C3=A8re (en g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ral, =
utilis=C3=A9e pour les entr=C3=A9es textuelles).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4032" data-end=3D"4064" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4036" data-end=3D"4064">=C3=89v=C3=A9nements de formulaire</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4066" data-end=3D"4365">
<li data-start=3D"4066" data-end=3D"4127" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4069" data-end=3D"4127" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
069" data-end=3D"4079">submit</strong> : Se d=C3=A9clenche lorsqu'un formul=
aire est soumis.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4128" data-end=3D"4280" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4131" data-end=3D"4280" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
131" data-end=3D"4141">change</strong> : Cet =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement se d=C3=A9=
clenche lorsqu'une modification est apport=C3=A9e =C3=A0 un champ de formul=
aire, comme un champ de saisie ou une case =C3=A0 cocher.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4281" data-end=3D"4365" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4284" data-end=3D"4365" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
284" data-end=3D"4293">input</strong> : Se d=C3=A9clenche lorsque la valeur=
 d'un champ de formulaire est modifi=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4367" data-end=3D"4396" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4371" data-end=3D"4396">=C3=89v=C3=A9nements de fen=C3=AAtre</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4398" data-end=3D"4668">
<li data-start=3D"4398" data-end=3D"4480" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4401" data-end=3D"4480" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
401" data-end=3D"4411">resize</strong> : Se d=C3=A9clenche lorsque la taill=
e de la fen=C3=AAtre du navigateur change.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4481" data-end=3D"4595" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4484" data-end=3D"4595" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
484" data-end=3D"4492">load</strong> : Se d=C3=A9clenche lorsque tous les =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de la page (images, scripts, etc.) sont compl=C3=A8temen=
t charg=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4596" data-end=3D"4668" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4599" data-end=3D"4668" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
599" data-end=3D"4609">scroll</strong> : Se d=C3=A9clenche lorsque l'utilis=
ateur fait d=C3=A9filer la page.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4670" data-end=3D"4673" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4675" data-end=3D"4712" class=3D"">3. =C3=89couter et g=
=C3=A9rer les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</h2>
