<li data-start=3D"7147" data-end=3D"7212" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7149" data-end=3D"7212" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"714=
9" data-end=3D"7161">event.type</code> : Le type de l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement (=
ex. <code data-start=3D"7192" data-end=3D"7199">click</code>, <code data-st=
art=3D"7201" data-end=3D"7210">keydown</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7213" data-end=3D"7329" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7215" data-end=3D"7329" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"721=
5" data-end=3D"7229">event.target</code> : L'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment qui a d=C3=
=A9clench=C3=A9 l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement (par exemple, l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment sur=
