<li data-start=3D"7330" data-end=3D"7420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7332" data-end=3D"7420" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"733=
2" data-end=3D"7347">event.keyCode</code> : Le code de la touche press=C3=
