<h2 data-start=3D"7834" data-end=3D"7869" class=3D"">5. La propagation des =
=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7871" data-end=3D"8049" class=3D"">La propagation des =C3=
=A9v=C3=A9nements se produit lorsque l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement se propage =C3=
=A0 travers le DOM, ce qui peut entra=C3=AEner une ex=C3=A9cution d'=C3=A9v=
=C3=A9nements sur des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments parents, enfants, etc.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"8051" data-end=3D"8093" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8055" data-end=3D"8093">La phase de capture et de bubbling</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"8095" data-end=3D"8277">
<li data-start=3D"8095" data-end=3D"8185" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8098" data-end=3D"8185" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
098" data-end=3D"8118">Phase de capture</strong> : L'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement se=
 propage de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment parent vers l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment cible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8186" data-end=3D"8277" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8189" data-end=3D"8277" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
189" data-end=3D"8210">Phase de bubbling</strong> : L'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement s=
e propage de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment cible vers l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment parent.</p>
</li>
</ol>
