341" data-end=3D"8364"><code data-start=3D"8343" data-end=3D"8362">stopProp=
agation()</code></strong> : Emp=C3=AAche la propagation de l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9n=
ement (arr=C3=AAte le processus de capture ou de bubbling).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8454" data-end=3D"8584" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8456" data-end=3D"8584" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
