<h3 data-start=3D"9016" data-end=3D"9070" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9020" data-end=3D"9070">Pourquoi utiliser la d=C3=A9l=C3=A9gation d'=C3=A9v=
=C3=A9nements ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9072" data-end=3D"9305" class=3D"">La d=C3=A9l=C3=A9gation=
