<h3 data-start=3D"11439" data-end=3D"11474" class=3D""><strong data-start=
=3D"11443" data-end=3D"11474">Optimisation des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"11476" data-end=3D"11631" class=3D"">=C3=89vitez les gesti=
onnaires d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements inutiles et choisissez des m=C3=A9thodes ef=
