<hr data-start=3D"9300" data-end=3D"9303" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9305" data-end=3D"9359" class=3D"">8. Propagation des =C3=
=A9v=C3=A9nements : Capture et Bubbling</h2>
<p data-start=3D"9361" data-end=3D"9468" class=3D"">La propagation des =C3=
=A9v=C3=A9nements se fait en deux phases : la phase de <strong data-start=
=3D"9428" data-end=3D"9439">capture</strong> et la phase de <strong data-st=
art=3D"9455" data-end=3D"9467">bubbling</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"9470" data-end=3D"9521" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9474" data-end=3D"9521">La phase de capture et la phase de bubbling</strong=
></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"9523" data-end=3D"9707">
<li data-start=3D"9523" data-end=3D"9620" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9525" data-end=3D"9620" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
525" data-end=3D"9536">Capture</strong> : L'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement commence pa=
r les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments parents et descend jusqu'=C3=A0 l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9men=
t cible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9621" data-end=3D"9707" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9623" data-end=3D"9707" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
623" data-end=3D"9635">Bubbling</strong> : L'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement commence p=
ar l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment cible et remonte vers les parents.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"9709" data-end=3D"9767" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9713" data-end=3D"9767">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"9724" data-end=3D"9743=
">stopPropagation()</code> et <code data-start=3D"9747" data-end=3D"9765">p=
reventDefault()</code></strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"9769" data-end=3D"9943">
<li data-start=3D"9769" data-end=3D"9834" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9771" data-end=3D"9834" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
771" data-end=3D"9794"><code data-start=3D"9773" data-end=3D"9792">stopProp=
agation()</code></strong> : Arr=C3=AAte la propagation de l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9ne=
ment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9835" data-end=3D"9943" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9837" data-end=3D"9943" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
837" data-end=3D"9859"><code data-start=3D"9839" data-end=3D"9857">preventD=
efault()</code></strong> : Annule l'action par d=C3=A9faut (par exemple, em=
p=C3=AAcher un formulaire de se soumettre).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"9945" data-end=3D"9948" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9950" data-end=3D"9979" class=3D"">9. D=C3=A9l=C3=A9gatio=
n d'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"9981" data-end=3D"10031" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D=
"9985" data-end=3D"10031">Qu'est-ce que la d=C3=A9l=C3=A9gation d'=C3=A9v=
=C3=A9nements ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"10033" data-end=3D"10256" class=3D"">La d=C3=A9l=C3=A9gati=
