<h3 data-start=3D"4545" data-end=3D"4598" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4549" data-end=3D"4598">Les n=C5=93uds DOM : =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments, attributs,=
 et texte</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4600" data-end=3D"4654" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"4603" data-end=3D"4611">n=C5=93ud</strong> dans le DOM peut =C3=AAtre d=
e plusieurs types :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4655" data-end=3D"4935">
<li data-start=3D"4655" data-end=3D"4739" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4657" data-end=3D"4739" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
657" data-end=3D"4675">N=C5=93ud d'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment</strong> : Repr=C3=A9s=
ente un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment HTML (par exemple <code data-start=3D"4718" data-=
end=3D"4724">&lt;h1&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"4726" data-end=3D"4731"=
>&lt;p&gt;</code>, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4740" data-end=3D"4856" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4742" data-end=3D"4856" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
742" data-end=3D"4759">N=C5=93ud de texte</strong> : Contient le texte =C3=
=A0 l'int=C3=A9rieur des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments (par exemple, le texte =C3=A0 l=
'int=C3=A9rieur d'un <code data-start=3D"4849" data-end=3D"4854">&lt;p&gt;<=
/code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4857" data-end=3D"4935" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4859" data-end=3D"4935" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
859" data-end=3D"4878">N=C5=93ud d'attribut</strong> : Repr=C3=A9sente un a=
ttribut HTML, comme <code data-start=3D"4916" data-end=3D"4920">id</code>, =
<code data-start=3D"4922" data-end=3D"4929">class</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
