ribut <code data-start=3D"4217" data-end=3D"4221">id</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4224" data-end=3D"4502" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4226" data-end=3D"4245" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
226" data-end=3D"4245">Inconv=C3=A9nients :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4502">
<li data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4502" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4250" data-end=3D"4502" class=3D"">Ne peut =C3=AAtre utili=
