<li data-start=3D"2748" data-end=3D"2971" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2750" data-end=3D"2971" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
750" data-end=3D"2797">Facilit=C3=A9 de gestion des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dyna=
miques</strong> : Si vous avez des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments qui sont ajout=C3=A9s=
