<h2 data-start=3D"1713" data-end=3D"1768" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1716" data-end=3D"1768">1. Pourquoi utiliser <code data-start=3D"1739" data=
-end=3D"1764">requestAnimationFrame()</code> ?</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1769" data-end=3D"1788" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 <strong data=
-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1788">Avantages</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1789" data-end=3D"2240">
<li data-start=3D"1789" data-end=3D"1926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1791" data-end=3D"1926" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
791" data-end=3D"1815">Performance optimale</strong> : <code data-start=3D"=
1818" data-end=3D"1843">requestAnimationFrame()</code> synchronise l=E2=80=
=99animation avec le rafra=C3=AEchissement de l=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran (g=C3=A9=
n=C3=A9ralement 60 FPS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1927" data-end=3D"2104" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1929" data-end=3D"2104" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
929" data-end=3D"1955">=C3=89conomie de ressources</strong> : Contrairement=
 =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"1974" data-end=3D"1989">setInterval()</code>, <=
code data-start=3D"1991" data-end=3D"2016">requestAnimationFrame()</code> a=
rr=C3=AAte l=E2=80=99animation si l=E2=80=99onglet n=E2=80=99est pas visibl=
e, =C3=A9conomisant ainsi les ressources CPU.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2105" data-end=3D"2240" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2107" data-end=3D"2240" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
107" data-end=3D"2134">Fluide et sans saccades</strong> : Pas de d=C3=A9lai=
s fixes entre les images, ce qui =C3=A9vite les effets de lag et garantit u=
ne transition fluide.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2242" data-end=3D"2265" class=3D"">=E2=9D=8C <strong data=
-start=3D"2248" data-end=3D"2265">Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2266" data-end=3D"2478">
<li data-start=3D"2266" data-end=3D"2322" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2268" data-end=3D"2322" class=3D"">N=C3=A9cessite une <str=
ong data-start=3D"2282" data-end=3D"2304">fonction r=C3=A9cursive</strong> =
pour fonctionner.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2323" data-end=3D"2390" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2325" data-end=3D"2390" class=3D"">Pas de param=C3=A8tre d=
e d=C3=A9lai personnalis=C3=A9 comme avec <code data-start=3D"2375" data-en=
d=3D"2389">setTimeout()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2391" data-end=3D"2478" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2393" data-end=3D"2478" class=3D"">Ne fonctionne pas sur <=
strong data-start=3D"2415" data-end=3D"2452">tous les navigateurs tr=C3=A8s=
 anciens</strong> (Internet Explorer &lt; 10).</p>
</li>
</ul>
