2794" data-end=3D"2825">3. Les =C3=89tats d'une promesse</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2827" data-end=3D"2868" class=3D"">Une promesse peut =C3=
=AAtre dans trois =C3=A9tats :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2870" data-end=3D"3090">
<li data-start=3D"2870" data-end=3D"2945" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2872" data-end=3D"2945" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
872" data-end=3D"2883">Pending</strong> : L'op=C3=A9ration n'est pas termin=
=C3=A9e. La promesse est en attente.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2946" data-end=3D"3026" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2948" data-end=3D"3026" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
948" data-end=3D"2961">Fulfilled</strong> : L'op=C3=A9ration est termin=C3=
=A9e avec succ=C3=A8s. La promesse est r=C3=A9solue.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3027" data-end=3D"3090" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3029" data-end=3D"3090" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
029" data-end=3D"3041">Rejected</strong> : L'op=C3=A9ration a =C3=A9chou=C3=
=A9. La promesse est rejet=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
