<ul data-start=3D"5999" data-end=3D"6340">
<li data-start=3D"5999" data-end=3D"6181" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6001" data-end=3D"6181" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
001" data-end=3D"6023">Exportation nomm=C3=A9e</strong> : Vous pouvez expor=
ter plusieurs =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans un m=C3=AAme module. L'importation de=
