<hr data-start=3D"7514" data-end=3D"7517" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7519" data-end=3D"7570" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7522" data-end=3D"7570">7. Chargement des modules dans un navigateur</stron=
