<p data-start=3D"2015" data-end=3D"2054" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9er des objets d=
e mani=C3=A8re structur=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2055" data-end=3D"2094" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2057" data-end=3D"2094" class=3D"">G=C3=A9rer des propri=
=C3=A9t=C3=A9s et des m=C3=A9thodes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2095" data-end=3D"2150" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2097" data-end=3D"2150" class=3D"">Utiliser l'h=C3=A9ritag=
e pour =C3=A9tendre des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
