<h3 data-start=3D"1780" data-end=3D"1818" class=3D"">1.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"1788" data-end=3D"1818">Qu'est-ce que l'h=C3=A9ritage ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1820" data-end=3D"2136" class=3D"">L'h=C3=A9ritage est un =
