<h2 data-start=3D"8000" data-end=3D"8036" class=3D"">3. Alternatives au sto=
ckage local</h2>
<p data-start=3D"8038" data-end=3D"8152" class=3D"">Bien que <code data-sta=
rt=3D"8047" data-end=3D"8061">localStorage</code> soit une solution pratiqu=
