<h3 data-start=3D"8586" data-end=3D"8627" class=3D"">6.2 Conversion entre f=
useaux horaires</h3>
<p data-start=3D"8629" data-end=3D"8881" class=3D"">La gestion des fuseaux =
horaires est complexe, et JavaScript ne fournit pas une API native simple p=
our cela. Cependant, des biblioth=C3=A8ques externes comme <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"8781" data-end=3D"8794">Moment.js</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"8=
798" data-end=3D"8810">date-fns</strong> permettent de g=C3=A9rer facilemen=
t les conversions entre fuseaux horaires.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"8883" data-end=3D"8886" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8888" data-end=3D"8927" class=3D"">7. M=C3=A9thodes Utile=
s pour l'Objet Date</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"8929" data-end=3D"9080">
<li data-start=3D"8929" data-end=3D"8973" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8931" data-end=3D"8973" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"893=
1" data-end=3D"8946">getFullYear()</code>, <code data-start=3D"8948" data-e=
nd=3D"8960">getMonth()</code>, <code data-start=3D"8962" data-end=3D"8973">=
getDate()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8974" data-end=3D"9018" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8976" data-end=3D"9018" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"897=
6" data-end=3D"8991">setFullYear()</code>, <code data-start=3D"8993" data-e=
nd=3D"9005">setMonth()</code>, <code data-start=3D"9007" data-end=3D"9018">=
setDate()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9019" data-end=3D"9045" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9021" data-end=3D"9045" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"902=
1" data-end=3D"9032">getTime()</code>, <code data-start=3D"9034" data-end=
