<h2 data-start=3D"7853" data-end=3D"7880" class=3D"">4. Moment.js vs Date-f=
ns</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7882" data-end=3D"8233">
<li data-start=3D"7882" data-end=3D"8019" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7884" data-end=3D"8019" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
884" data-end=3D"7897">Moment.js</strong> est plus lourd et propose une API=
 tout-en-un, id=C3=A9ale pour les projets qui n=C3=A9cessitent beaucoup de =
manipulation des dates.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8020" data-end=3D"8233" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8022" data-end=3D"8233" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
022" data-end=3D"8034">Date-fns</strong> est plus l=C3=A9ger et modulaire, =
offrant des fonctions sp=C3=A9cifiques que vous pouvez importer au fur et =
=C3=A0 mesure de vos besoins. Il est pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rable pour les projets =
o=C3=B9 la taille du bundle est une priorit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8235" data-end=3D"8263" class=3D"">Avantages de Moment.js=
 :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8264" data-end=3D"8324">
<li data-start=3D"8264" data-end=3D"8287" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8266" data-end=3D"8287" class=3D"">API simple et fluide.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8288" data-end=3D"8324" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8290" data-end=3D"8324" class=3D"">Large communaut=C3=A9 e=
t documentation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8326" data-end=3D"8353" class=3D"">Avantages de Date-fns =
:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8354" data-end=3D"8479">
<li data-start=3D"8354" data-end=3D"8367" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8356" data-end=3D"8367" class=3D"">Plus l=C3=A9ger.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8368" data-end=3D"8407" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8370" data-end=3D"8407" class=3D"">Plus rapide en termes d=
e performance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8408" data-end=3D"8479" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8410" data-end=3D"8479" class=3D"">Fonctionnalit=C3=A9 mod=
ulaire, charge uniquement ce dont vous avez besoin.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8481" data-end=3D"8484" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8486" data-end=3D"8523" class=3D"">5. Bonnes Pratiques et=
