<p data-start=3D"3159" data-end=3D"3215" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"315=
9" data-end=3D"3168">fetch()</code> est largement utilis=C3=A9 pour plusieu=
rs raisons :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3217" data-end=3D"3756">
<li data-start=3D"3217" data-end=3D"3398" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3219" data-end=3D"3398" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
219" data-end=3D"3249">Promesses et asynchronisme</strong> : Contrairement =
