</li>
<li data-start=3D"6438" data-end=3D"6574" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6440" data-end=3D"6574" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
440" data-end=3D"6463">Valeurs non valides</strong> : JSON n'accepte que de=
