<hr data-start=3D"6997" data-end=3D"7000" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7002" data-end=3D"7036" class=3D"">6. Avantages et limite=
s de JSON</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7038" data-end=3D"7063" class=3D"">6.1 Avantages de JSON<=
/h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7065" data-end=3D"7340">
<li data-start=3D"7065" data-end=3D"7119" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7067" data-end=3D"7119" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
067" data-end=3D"7081">Simplicit=C3=A9</strong> : JSON est facile =C3=A0 li=
re et =C3=A0 =C3=A9crire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7120" data-end=3D"7188" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7122" data-end=3D"7188" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
122" data-end=3D"7142">Interop=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9</strong> : JSON est suppo=
rt=C3=A9 par de nombreux langages.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7189" data-end=3D"7233" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7191" data-end=3D"7233" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
191" data-end=3D"7202">Compact</strong> : JSON est plus l=C3=A9ger que XML.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7234" data-end=3D"7340" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7236" data-end=3D"7340" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
236" data-end=3D"7258">Facile =C3=A0 convertir</strong> : En JavaScript, vo=
us pouvez facilement convertir un objet en JSON et vice versa.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7342" data-end=3D"7365" class=3D"">6.2 Limites de JSON</h=
3>
<ul data-start=3D"7367" data-end=3D"7664">
<li data-start=3D"7367" data-end=3D"7522" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7369" data-end=3D"7522" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
369" data-end=3D"7397">Types de donn=C3=A9es limit=C3=A9s</strong> : JSON n=
e peut pas stocker certaines donn=C3=A9es complexes comme des fonctions ou =
des objets de type <code data-start=3D"7495" data-end=3D"7501">Date</code> =
sans transformation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7523" data-end=3D"7664" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7525" data-end=3D"7664" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
525" data-end=3D"7548">Pas de commentaires</strong> : JSON ne permet pas le=
s commentaires, ce qui peut rendre la documentation un peu plus difficile d=
ans certains cas.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7666" data-end=3D"7669" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7671" data-end=3D"7706" class=3D"">7. Applications avanc=
=C3=A9es de JSON</h2>
