<h2 data-start=3D"5735" data-end=3D"5760" class=3D"">3. Les API de Stockage=
</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5762" data-end=3D"5933" class=3D"">Les API de stockage per=
mettent de stocker des donn=C3=A9es c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 client dans le navigateu=
r, facilitant ainsi la gestion des donn=C3=A9es persistantes entre les sess=
ions utilisateurs.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5935" data-end=3D"5972" class=3D"">3.1 Stockage local (Lo=
calStorage)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5974" data-end=3D"6079" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"5977" data-end=3D"5993">localStorage</strong> est une API simple qui pe=
rmet de stocker des donn=C3=A9es sous forme de paires cl=C3=A9-valeur.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6081" data-end=3D"6475">
<li data-start=3D"6081" data-end=3D"6116" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6083" data-end=3D"6116" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
083" data-end=3D"6095">Capacit=C3=A9</strong> : G=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement 5 Mo=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6117" data-end=3D"6207" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6119" data-end=3D"6207" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
