<li data-start=3D"5962" data-end=3D"6043" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5964" data-end=3D"6043" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
964" data-end=3D"5985">Major version (X)</strong> : Modifications incompati=
bles avec la version pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dente.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6044" data-end=3D"6144" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6046" data-end=3D"6144" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
046" data-end=3D"6067">Minor version (Y)</strong> : Ajout de nouvelles fonc=
tionnalit=C3=A9s compatibles avec la version pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dente.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6145" data-end=3D"6230" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6147" data-end=3D"6230" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
147" data-end=3D"6168">Patch version (Z)</strong> : Corrections de bugs com=
patibles avec la version pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dente.</p>
</li>
</ul>
